WEBVTT

00:10:58.946 --> 00:11:01.407
by focusing on this issue,

00:11:01.448 --> 00:11:05.202
we actually have opened the aperture
of opportunity for everyone.

00:11:05.244 --> 00:11:07.746
So we are making progress.

00:11:07.746 --> 00:11:12.084
And I really think that our objective

00:11:12.084 --> 00:11:16.088
is, in 10 years, to have created

00:11:16.088 --> 00:11:19.383
a million family-sustaining jobs.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:23.262
WPR: So OneTen
is one million jobs in 10 years.

00:11:23.303 --> 00:11:24.763
KC: In 10 years.

00:11:24.805 --> 00:11:27.182
You know, simple, objective --

00:11:27.182 --> 00:11:28.726
not easy, right?

00:11:28.767 --> 00:11:31.979
Because part of what we're doing